# Menu & navigation

## Rules

- Start battle only by emitting `MainEvents.ev_start_game`
  - Campaign: `{ "battle_info": GameConfig.BattleInfo(...) }`
  - Training: `{ "custom_battle": GameConfig }`
- Return: `ev_return_to_menu`; quit battle early: `ev_exit_game`
- Nested menu UI: `WindowStackManager` / `ButtonWindowTransition` — don't invent a second stack
- Training settings persist via `ResourceUtils` to `user://training_settings.tres`

## Placement

- Level select UI → `menu_context/levels/`
- Training UI → `menu_context/training_room_window/`
- Results UI → `post_battle_context/`
- Account/progress controllers stay under `main_context/account/`
- New/changed UI controls → edit the `.tscn` in the editor (or provide editor steps); scripts only bind and set state
- Menus/HUD must be comfortable on Mobile, Steam, and HTML (touch targets, safe area, mouse/keyboard)

## Avoid

- Loading `GameContext` directly from menu scripts
- Duplicating unlock logic outside `ProgressController` / `conditions.gd`
- Creating menu/window UI trees in GDScript instead of scene nodes / item templates
- UI that only works well on one platform
